{"source": "app_details", "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/api/appdetails?appids=552990&cc=us&l=english", "collected_at": "2026-10-14T01:25:08Z", "http_status": 200, "payload": {"552990": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "World of Warships", "steam_appid": 552990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "dlc": [4261730, 2283211, 1991000, 4261760, 1889260, 1954920, 934650, 934680, 3197530, 934660, 2569960, 2316650, 934640, 1880790, 844890, 1954810, 1953740, 3016850, 934690, 1005550, 1690140, 1739020, 845000, 2569970, 1224060], "detailed_description": "<h1>Limited Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552990/extras/03ca9724a7b11e43b0d23d49d6a0be77.avif?t=1791478284\" width=1202 height=300 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552990/extras/8a12e9cb62d27c97ff8daac5473b33bb.poster.avif?t=1791478284\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552990/extras/8a12e9cb62d27c97ff8daac5473b33bb.webm?t=1791478284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Naval warfare has never looked this good!</strong> Download World of Warships for <strong>FREE</strong> and engage in thrilling battles between massive fleets across a multitude of gigantic maps. Every maneuver, salvo, and push can mean the difference between utmost triumph and total defeat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552990/extras/61a488e1679fb16d9faf844a223f4f57.poster.avif?t=1791478284\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552990/extras/61a488e1679fb16d9faf844a223f4f57.webm?t=1791478284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552990/extras/61a488e1679fb16d9faf844a223f4f57.mp4?t=1791478284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the mighty Yamato to the elusive U-190, explore a near-bottomless sea of playstyles aboard historic battleships, destroyers, cruisers, submarines, and aircraft carriers—each faithfully recreated in 3D. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552990/extras/acb2b931105ecadec158bd9a1a60eff5.poster.avif?t=1791478284\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552990/extras/acb2b931105ecadec158bd9a1a60eff5.webm?t=1791478284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the life of a lone wolf is not for you, invite your friends to a Division and put your co-operative skills to the test! If you're looking for a real challenge, join a Clan, climb to the top of the Clan league, and strive to be the best on your server!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552990/extras/4321d0effc72f1c769566f459b9a762a.poster.avif?t=1791478284\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552990/extras/4321d0effc72f1c769566f459b9a762a.webm?t=1791478284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plot a course across 13 national Tech Trees and fine-tune your personal approach to naval combat by installing modifications, unlocking skills for your Commanders, and augmenting your fleet’s appearance with camouflages and more cosmetics.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552990/extras/8a12e9cb62d27c97ff8daac5473b33bb.poster.avif?t=1791478284\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552990/extras/8a12e9cb62d27c97ff8daac5473b33bb.webm?t=1791478284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Naval warfare has never looked this good!</strong> Download World of Warships for <strong>FREE</strong> and engage in thrilling battles between massive fleets across a multitude of gigantic maps. Every maneuver, salvo, and push can mean the difference between utmost triumph and total defeat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552990/extras/61a488e1679fb16d9faf844a223f4f57.poster.avif?t=1791478284\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552990/extras/61a488e1679fb16d9faf844a223f4f57.webm?t=1791478284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552990/extras/61a488e1679fb16d9faf844a223f4f57.mp4?t=1791478284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the mighty Yamato to the elusive U-190, explore a near-bottomless sea of playstyles aboard historic battleships, destroyers, cruisers, submarines, and aircraft carriers—each faithfully recreated in 3D. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552990/extras/acb2b931105ecadec158bd9a1a60eff5.poster.avif?t=1791478284\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552990/extras/acb2b931105ecadec158bd9a1a60eff5.webm?t=1791478284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the life of a lone wolf is not for you, invite your friends to a Division and put your co-operative skills to the test! If you're looking for a real challenge, join a Clan, climb to the top of the Clan league, and strive to be the best on your server!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552990/extras/4321d0effc72f1c769566f459b9a762a.poster.avif?t=1791478284\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552990/extras/4321d0effc72f1c769566f459b9a762a.webm?t=1791478284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plot a course across 13 national Tech Trees and fine-tune your personal approach to naval combat by installing modifications, unlocking skills for your Commanders, and augmenting your fleet’s appearance with camouflages and more cosmetics.</p>", "short_description": "Immerse yourself in thrilling naval battles and assemble an armada of over 800 ships from the first half of the 20th century — from stealthy destroyers to gigantic battleships. Change the look of your ship, choose upgrades to suit your play style, and go into battle with other players!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Czech, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Polish<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Thai, Turkish, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Ukrainian, Dutch<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“When it all comes together around two competent teams working together, World of Warships is a glorious pre-World War 2 admiralty fantasy come to life.”<br>8.3/10 – IGN<br><br>“Its mix of ponderous warships and huge guns—the biggest guns ever fired in anger by mankind—is beautiful, polished, and a joy to play.”<br>80/100 – PCGamer<br><br>“The thrills that await, along with the promise of unlocking advanced ships down the road, make World of Warships an enticing expedition into the sometimes turbulent waters of free-to-play games.”<br>8/10 – Gamespot<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552990/9684685d206bf6a74fb21cdb49eb4748c61b1c79/header_alt_assets_16.jpg?t=1791478284", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552990/e4946bba05ec1edf85048ae0cf6f47572aabb7fa/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_16.jpg?t=1791478284", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552990/e4946bba05ec1edf85048ae0cf6f47572aabb7fa/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_16.jpg?t=1791478284", "website": "https://steam.worldofwarships.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 x64<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel® Core™ i3-3210 3,2 GHz  AMD Athlon™ X4 970 Quad Core 3,8 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1280x720; Nvidia®Geforce® GT 640  Intel UHD 630  AMD Radeon™ R7 240<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Versi